Rhea fires! The turret takes 3 damage.
The turret fires back!
Vex breaks another security lock.
The turret fires back!
Rhea guards Vex and lands a quick shot.
The team avoids the counterattack.
Vex breaks another security lock.
The turret fires back!
One security lock remains.
Vex breaks another security lock.
VICTORY! Vex opens Vault Nine.



THERE IT IS! PARACINE JUST RAN YOUR GAME NATIVELY!







