Turn 1	Blast: 9 → 6 HP. Turret retaliates.
Turn 2	Blast: 6 → 3 HP. Turret retaliates.
Turn 3	Blast: 3 → 0 HP. Turret destroyed.


Notice that the turret did not retaliate after receiving the fatal shot. That means the program correctly reevaluated its state before executing the enemy's attack.
